*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% Epson TM-T20III thermal receipt printer (ESC/POS), 80 mm roll, auto-cutter.
*%
*% CUPS PPD that turns the queue from a raw pass-through into a real driver:
*% the rastertoescpos filter converts PDF into ESC/POS raster bytes and appends
*% the 10 mm feed + auto-cut, then the socket backend delivers those bytes to
*% the printer at 192.168.192.168:9100.
*%
*% This is what fixes the two symptoms the raw queue had:
*%   * Chromium/Firefox had no MediaSize to offer, so the print button was
*%     disabled / the paper-size list was empty. This PPD declares Roll80mm.
*%   * The raw queue cut right after the last band, leaving the trailing line
*%     on the next ticket. The filter feeds 10 mm before cutting.
*%
*FormatVersion:	"4.3"
*FileVersion:	"1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName:	"EPSONTM.PPD"
*Manufacturer:	"Epson"
*Product:	"(TM-T20III Receipt Printer)"
*cupsVersion:	1.0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber:  2
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-pdf 0 rastertoescpos"
*ModelName:     "Epson TM-T20III"
*ShortNickName: "Epson TM-T20III (80mm)"
*NickName:      "Epson TM-T20III Receipt, 80mm roll, ESC/POS"
*PSVersion:	"(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel:	"2"
*ColorDevice:	False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*TTRasterizer:	Type42
*Throughput:	"30"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Roll80mm
*PageSize Roll80mm/80mm receipt roll: "<</PageSize[227 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*% The printer is monochrome and only ever reports "ready"/printer default
*% states; no HWMargins or resolution beyond what the filter hard-codes (203dpi).
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi

*% Standard boilerplate so CUPS treats this as a valid single-page-size queue.
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Roll80mm
*PageRegion Roll80mm/80mm receipt roll: "<</PageSize[227 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Roll80mm
*ImageableArea Roll80mm/80mm receipt roll: "0 0 227 842"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Roll80mm
*PaperDimension Roll80mm/80mm receipt roll: "227 842"
